            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9538, 10mm Stainless Steel Charlotte Metro Cabinet Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nUtilitarian in design, the 10mm Stainless Steel Charlotte Metro Cabinet Handle is great for both traditional and modern decors. It is available in 3 sizes, all of which come in a brushed stainless steel finish. The 10mm Charlotte Metro Stainless Steel Cabinet Pull comes with the mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Charlotte Metro Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n\r\n<b>9538/76</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length center to center: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 3-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 10mm</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>9538/102</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length center to center: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 10mm</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>9538/127</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length center to center: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 10\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
